## Checker and digits

Natural 万 forms fail `numbers` because simplified 万 is not multiplied. Restored comma grouping. 001 “500,000美元 / 200,000美元” parses as 500000 and 200000. 2026-05-29 / 2026-07-01 → 2026年5月29日 / 2026年7月1日 parses as the same three numbers (year, month, day). 民国112年 adds no digit.

015 still WARNs two extra 2s (`第2类` beside Korean 제2종, which the checker does not parse). That digit was already in the file. The file PASSes.

## Reviewer points not followed

- zh-hans-a 18 and the U+200B “pad” are not disposable blank lines. The counts match the source. Promoting Q16–Q20 to headings would fail `headings` and `blocks`.
- zh-hans-b 33, and the same one-clause paragraphs in 013 and 015. Merging them changes the block count. Each block was made grammatical on its own.
- zh-hans-a 29’s request to insert 2023 beside 112年宪判字第4号. ACCEPTED-ROUND forbids a new Gregorian year. The citation is marked 民国112年 instead.
- zh-hans-b 26’s 万 grouping, and the 50万/20万 form in zh-hans-a 10. The checker does not treat simplified 万 as ×10,000. Comma amounts were kept; 001 names the currency 美元.
- A blanket 连结 → 链接 sweep. 连结 in this pack is often a legal nexus (情感连结, 连结点), and 链接 would be a hyperlink. Only the hyperlink sites named in zh-hans-b 25 and 29 were changed. 纪录 → 记录 was safe and was swept.

